    "sections": {
        "description": "The Watch Showcase theme is designed with a structured layout that highlights products, collections, and visual content in a clean and organized manner. It includes responsive page sections, customizable banners, product display areas, featured collections, and image galleries that adapt across different screen sizes. The theme supports navigation menus, call-to-action buttons, and content blocks that help present information clearly. Built-in customization settings allow adjustments to colors, typography, layouts, and homepage sections without modifying core files. Additional features include product categorization, blog integration, social media links, contact sections, and widget-ready areas for added functionality. The design emphasizes readability and balanced spacing, making it suitable for displaying detailed product information, specifications, and images. It is compatible with modern browsers and follows responsive design standards to ensure a consistent viewing experience on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The theme also supports search functionality, footer customization, and multiple page templates that help organize content effectively. Its flexible structure allows different presentation styles while maintaining a cohesive visual appearance across the entire website."
    },
